[{"id":"archive-642","post_id":"642","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103377702962981","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-31","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/642/","text":"Reflecting on a year of new challenges, opportunities and hope for a better future.\n\nHere are some of my favorite moments from 2016.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103377702962981","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-641","post_id":"641","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103370750850071","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-28","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/641/","text":"A few years ago, Priscilla and I visited Kauai and fell in love with the community and the cloudy green mountains. We kept coming back with family and friends, and eventually decided to plant roots...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103370750850071","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-640","post_id":"640","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103368234757341","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-27","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/640/","text":"Running around the world in 2016 and beyond. Thanks to everyone who ran with me!","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103368234757341","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-927","post_id":"927","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103361432294531/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-24","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/927/","text":"My favorite part of this year's 365 mile running challenge is the group A Year of Running. More than 130,000 people joined me around the world. I've loved reading your stories about how running has...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103361432294531/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-988","post_id":"988","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103353413344571/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-21","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/988/","text":"After seeing Jarvis from my perspective and Priscilla's, we thought it would be funny to do one from the AI's perspective too. Morgan Freeman is absolutely brilliant.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103353413344571/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-270","post_id":"270","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103353645165001/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-21","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/270/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-987","post_id":"987","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103351403412491/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-20","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/987/","text":"Priscilla's experience with Jarvis has been a little different...\n\nThis one is based on mishaps she endured while I built Jarvis.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103351403412491/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-926","post_id":"926","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103351034741311/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-20","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/926/","text":"After a year of coding, here's Jarvis.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103351034741311/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-639","post_id":"639","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103348868756961","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-19","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/639/","text":"I showed Jarvis to Fast Company and they wrote this piece. Check it out if you want to see some quick video demos of Jarvis working. Tomorrow I'm going to drop some fun videos Priscilla and I made...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","tex