stablished the Breakthrough Prize five years ago with the belief that our society should celebrate the scientists who advance our understanding of the world as much as we celebrate...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103303594716501","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-265","post_id":"265","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/vb.4/10103303356633621","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-04","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/265/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-635","post_id":"635","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103297997238891","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-02","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/635/","text":"Affordable housing is an important problem across the world. Our goal is to connect people everywhere, and that starts with being good neighbors in our local community.\n\nFor all the opportunity and...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103297997238891","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-634","post_id":"634","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103295730681091","published_at":null,"published_date":"2016-12-01","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/634/","text":"A year ago, Pris